    <description>Migrated from the: Copy Billing Address Canada workflow rule,Copy Billing Address USA workflow rule,Copy Billing Address Other workflow rule
Workflow rule description: If the Same As Service Address is checked, we need to populate the Billing Address fields so that they are exposed to customers on the Customer Experience form&quot;</description>
